<title>MEXICO: BBVPro Q1 1997 net 89.23 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>BBVPro Q1 1997 net 89.23 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p>	Net		    89.23 million		47.62 million</p>
<p>	Revs		   46.44 million		77.96 million</p>
<p>	Oper Costs	   37.72 million		36.63 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Financiero BBV Probursa.</p>
<p>The Q1 1997 results were reported for the first time using U.S. GAAP accounting standards.</p>
<p>((--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
